(C) research has demonstrated overwhelming evidence of

(D) our ability to generate innovative solutions to complex problems
while', NULL, '[{"id":"opt-0739daeb-4134-5b35-b24e-589b4a694fdf-1","text":"(D), (B), (C), (A)"},{"id":"opt-0739daeb-4134-5b35-b24e-589b4a694fdf-2","text":"(C), (A), (B), (D)"},{"id":"opt-0739daeb-4134-5b35-b24e-589b4a694fdf-3","text":"(A), (C), (D), (B)"},{"id":"opt-0739daeb-4134-5b35-b24e-589b4a694fdf-4","text":"(C), (A), (D), (B)"}]', NULL, 'D', 'The coherent sentence formed :

