(D) Ravi has no choice but to _______ in a school close to his house. (IV) has studied', NULL, '[{"id":"opt-c7133958-0409-533c-aa61-5fa75fd84f71-1","text":"(A) - (II), (B) - (I), (C) - (III), (D) - (IV)"},{"id":"opt-c7133958-0409-533c-aa61-5fa75fd84f71-2","text":"(A) - (III), (B) - (II), (C) - (I), (D) - (IV)"},{"id":"opt-c7133958-0409-533c-aa61-5fa75fd84f71-3","text":"(A) - (IV), (B) - (I), (C) - (II), (D) - (III)"},{"id":"opt-c7133958-0409-533c-aa61-5fa75fd84f71-4","text":"(A) - (I), (B) - (IV), (C) - (III), (D) - (II)"}]', NULL, 'C', '(A) - (IV), (B) - (I), (C) - (II), (D) - (III)', NULL, 2025, 'CUET UG English 2025 Shift 1', 'medium', 1, 0, 1, '2026-10-30T05:34:53.676Z', '2026-10-30T05:34:53.676Z', 16, NULL, NULL, 3, 'C', 'source_key_recorded', NULL, 30, 31, 'English_2025-05-20_Shift_1.pdf');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO "Question" ("id", "subjectId", "chapterId", "type", "stemEn", "stemHi", "optionsEn", "optionsHi", "correctAnswer", "explanationEn", "explanationHi", "year", "source", "difficulty", "marks", "negativeMarks", "isActive", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "questionNumber", "passageId", "passageKey", "sourceCorrectOptionOrder", "sourceAnswerLabel", "answerReviewStatus", "dataQualityNote", "sourcePageStart", "sourcePageEnd", "sourcePdfFilename") VALUES ('a1cc03b6-250f-5bad-844e-c627960f43d1', 'cmvujfpmo0000pj85qeni7e8e', NULL, 'single_choice', 'Fill in the blanks in the given sentences in List-I with the
