A careful ‘preservation and protection’ of the flora and fauna is the
need of the hour.', NULL, '[{"id":"opt-77b44f14-e0d2-539f-b773-a642b439e20e-1","text":"Conservation"},{"id":"opt-77b44f14-e0d2-539f-b773-a642b439e20e-2","text":"Promotion"},{"id":"opt-77b44f14-e0d2-539f-b773-a642b439e20e-3","text":"Enhancement"},{"id":"opt-77b44f14-e0d2-539f-b773-a642b439e20e-4","text":"Management"}]', NULL, 'A', 'The single word that means the careful preservation and protection of natural resources, including flora and
fauna, is Conservation. (Note: Option 1 is spelled as ''Consevation'', but it clearly refers to ''Conservation'').', NULL, 2025, 'CUET UG English 2025 Shift 1', 'medium', 1, 0, 1, '2026-10-30T05:34:53.735Z', '2026-10-30T05:34:53.735Z', 28, NULL, NULL, 1, 'A', 'source_key_recorded', NULL, 40, 41, 'English_2025-05-20_Shift_1.pdf');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO "Question" ("id", "subjectId", "chapterId", "type", "stemEn", "stemHi", "optionsEn", "optionsHi", "correctAnswer", "explanationEn", "explanationHi", "year", "source", "difficulty", "marks", "negativeMarks", "isActive", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "questionNumber", "passageId", "passageKey", "sourceCorrectOptionOrder", "sourceAnswerLabel", "answerReviewStatus", "dataQualityNote", "sourcePageStart", "sourcePageEnd", "sourcePdfFilename") VALUES ('cb1fec36-21b9-57e6-822f-a6a968cf7464', 'cmvujfpmo0000pj85qeni7e8e', NULL, 'single_choice', 'Select the most appropriate word to fill in the blank in the following
sentence:-

The oppressive regime continued to ______ anyone who spoke out
against its injustices.', NULL, '[{"id":"opt-cb1fec36-21b9-57e6-822f-a6a968cf7464-1","text":"prosecute"},{"id":"opt-cb1fec36-21b9-57e6-822f-a6a968cf7464-2","text":"perpetuate"},{"id":"opt-cb1fec36-21b9-57e6-822f-a6a968cf7464-3","text":"persecute"},{"id":"opt-cb1fec36-21b9-57e6-822f-a6a968cf7464-4","text":"provoke"}]', NULL, 'C', 'The sentence describes an oppressive regime''s actions against people who spoke out against injustices.

Persecute means to subject someone to hostility and ill-treatment, especially because of their political
or religious beliefs.
Prosecute means to conduct legal proceedings against. Perpetuate means to make something continue
indefinitely.', NULL, 2025, 'CUET UG English 2025 Shift 1', 'medium', 1, 0, 1, '2026-10-30T05:34:53.740Z', '2026-10-30T05:34:53.740Z', 29, NULL, NULL, 3, 'C', 'source_key_recorded', NULL, 41, 42, 'English_2025-05-20_Shift_1.pdf');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO "Question" ("id", "subjectId", "chapterId", "type", "stemEn", "stemHi", "optionsEn", "optionsHi", "correctAnswer", "explanationEn", "explanationHi", "year", "source", "difficulty", "marks", "negativeMarks", "isActive", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "questionNumber", "passageId", "passageKey", "sourceCorrectOptionOrder", "sourceAnswerLabel", "answerReviewStatus", "dataQualityNote", "sourcePageStart", "sourcePageEnd", "sourcePdfFilename") VALUES ('5b4cf470-168d-5c23-ae40-97db2f8465b6', 'cmvujfpmo0000pj85qeni7e8e', NULL, 'single_choice', 'Select the most appropriate expression to fill in the blank in the
following sentence:-

Given her fearful and timid nature in unfamiliar situations, we can
say that she is ____', NULL, '[{"id":"opt-5b4cf470-168d-5c23-ae40-97db2f8465b6-1","text":"audacious"},{"id":"opt-5b4cf470-168d-5c23-ae40-97db2f8465b6-2","text":"timorous"},{"id":"opt-5b4cf470-168d-5c23-ae40-97db2f8465b6-3","text":"reckless"},{"id":"opt-5b4cf470-168d-5c23-ae40-97db2f8465b6-4","text":"intrepid"}]', NULL, 'B', 'The sentence describes a fearful and timid nature in unfamiliar situations.

Timorous means showing or suffering from nervousness, fear, or a lack of confidence; timid.
Audacious and intrepid mean brave/fearless. Reckless means without thought for danger.', NULL, 2025, 'CUET UG English 2025 Shift 1', 'medium', 1, 0, 1, '2026-10-30T05:34:53.744Z', '2026-10-30T05:34:53.744Z', 30, NULL, NULL, 2, 'B', 'source_key_recorded', NULL, 42, 43, 'English_2025-05-20_Shift_1.pdf');
