(B) She gave a ________ first performance at the theatre. (II) conscious
(C) My ________ made me confess my guilt. (III) credulous
(D) We soon became ________ of the presence of an intruder. (IV) conscience', NULL, '[{"id":"opt-936039f9-6410-58a6-b46a-4793f0465c90-1","text":"(A) - (I), (B) - (II), (C) - (III), (D) - (IV)"},{"id":"opt-936039f9-6410-58a6-b46a-4793f0465c90-2","text":"(A) - (III), (B) - (I), (C) - (IV), (D) - (II)"},{"id":"opt-936039f9-6410-58a6-b46a-4793f0465c90-3","text":"(A) - (I), (B) - (II), (C) - (IV), (D) - (III)"},{"id":"opt-936039f9-6410-58a6-b46a-4793f0465c90-4","text":"(A) - (III), (B) - (IV), (C) - (I), (D) - (II)"}]', NULL, 'B', '(A) - (III), (B) - (I), (C) - (IV), (D) - (II)', NULL, 2025, 'CUET UG English 2025 Shift 1', 'medium', 1, 0, 1, '2026-10-30T05:34:53.796Z', '2026-10-30T05:34:53.796Z', 40, NULL, NULL, 2, 'B', 'source_key_recorded', NULL, 51, 52, 'English_2025-05-20_Shift_1.pdf');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO "Question" ("id", "subjectId", "chapterId", "type", "stemEn", "stemHi", "optionsEn", "optionsHi", "correctAnswer", "explanationEn", "explanationHi", "year", "source", "difficulty", "marks", "negativeMarks", "isActive", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "questionNumber", "passageId", "passageKey", "sourceCorrectOptionOrder", "sourceAnswerLabel", "answerReviewStatus", "dataQualityNote", "sourcePageStart", "sourcePageEnd", "sourcePdfFilename") VALUES ('c79d8886-dbfb-57be-84cc-083d6f143e8f', 'cmvujfpmo0000pj85qeni7e8e', NULL, 'single_choice', 'Rearrange the following parts to form a meaningful sentence:-

(A) into simpler molecules that can be absorbed into the
bloodstream
(B) digestion is an intricate process that begins in the mouth

(C) where food is broken down mechanically and chemically

(D) and continues in the stomach and intestines', NULL, '[{"id":"opt-c79d8886-dbfb-57be-84cc-083d6f143e8f-1","text":"(B), (C), (A), (D)"},{"id":"opt-c79d8886-dbfb-57be-84cc-083d6f143e8f-2","text":"(B), (D), (C), (A)"},{"id":"opt-c79d8886-dbfb-57be-84cc-083d6f143e8f-3","text":"(B), (A), (C), (D)"},{"id":"opt-c79d8886-dbfb-57be-84cc-083d6f143e8f-4","text":"(C), (B), (A), (D)"}]', NULL, 'B', 'Coherent Sentence:

Digestion is an intricate process that begins in the mouth where food is broken down mechanically and
chemically and continues in the stomach and intestines into simpler molecules that can be absorbed into the
bloodstream. (BCDA should be the correct sequence)', NULL, 2025, 'CUET UG English 2025 Shift 1', 'medium', 1, 0, 1, '2026-10-30T05:34:53.801Z', '2026-10-30T05:34:53.801Z', 41, NULL, NULL, 2, 'B', 'needs_manual_review', 'Printed answer key says B (choice 2), while the solution states sequence BCDA, which is not among the listed choices; its reconstructed sentence also appears internally inconsistent. Manual verification required.', 52, 53, 'English_2025-05-20_Shift_1.pdf');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO "Question" ("id", "subjectId", "chapterId", "type", "stemEn", "stemHi", "optionsEn", "optionsHi", "correctAnswer", "explanationEn", "explanationHi", "year", "source", "difficulty", "marks", "negativeMarks", "isActive", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "questionNumber", "passageId", "passageKey", "sourceCorrectOptionOrder", "sourceAnswerLabel", "answerReviewStatus", "dataQualityNote", "sourcePageStart", "sourcePageEnd", "sourcePdfFilename") VALUES ('d72a1ce3-bc25-52d8-8208-99c5d0da268f', 'cmvujfpmo0000pj85qeni7e8e', NULL, 'single_choice', 'Select the word opposite in meaning to the word: Stoic', NULL, '[{"id":"opt-d72a1ce3-bc25-52d8-8208-99c5d0da268f-1","text":"Serene"},{"id":"opt-d72a1ce3-bc25-52d8-8208-99c5d0da268f-2","text":"Complaining"},{"id":"opt-d72a1ce3-bc25-52d8-8208-99c5d0da268f-3","text":"Resigned"},{"id":"opt-d72a1ce3-bc25-52d8-8208-99c5d0da268f-4","text":"stolid"}]', NULL, 'B', 'Stoic (enduring pain without complaining) and thus complaining is its antonym.', NULL, 2025, 'CUET UG English 2025 Shift 1', 'medium', 1, 0, 1, '2026-10-30T05:34:53.806Z', '2026-10-30T05:34:53.806Z', 42, NULL, NULL, 2, 'B', 'source_key_recorded', NULL, 53, 53, 'English_2025-05-20_Shift_1.pdf');
